{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e10-scene-09",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "出任新一季十二歌王的主持人  (Hosting the New Season of Twelve Singers)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "wen_simo": "闻思默"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At the revamp review meeting, the cautious DTS network director brings in veteran anchor Wen Simo as a respected authority—and Wen Simo keeps everyone on edge by declaring he has a huge objection to Chun Yuqiao's plan. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在广告商那边已经同意改版了，邓主任是不是可以推动台里通过改版呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "邓主任有什么建议？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "我想知道，你们这个改版方案是谁搞的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "怪不得呢，我都看了，我很有意见。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "有什么想法你说出来吧，在我们星天一向欢迎争论的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "这点我深有体会。我在这个圈子混了二十年了，这样的改版方案我前所未见。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "对于一个引进节目做这种高度的本土化创新，这在中国的电视界从来没有过。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "如果我们台能够率先垂范接受这个方案，不仅会提高我们的品牌价值。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "这个改版方案最大的问题在于，这么好玩的事怎么不带我一块儿玩呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "闻老师，你不愧是独步江湖的段子手，我们开个讨论会你还卖关子呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你们星天要是不嫌弃的话，我个人愿意出任新一季十二歌王的主持人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你要重回综艺舞台？闻老师，一言为定！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在广告商那边已经同意改版了，邓主任是不是可以推动台里通过改版呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now that the advertisers have agreed to the revamp, can you help push approval through at the network?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "邓主任有什么建议？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What suggestions do you have in mind?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "我想知道，你们这个改版方案是谁搞的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I would like to know who came up with this revamp proposal of yours.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "怪不得呢，我都看了，我很有意见。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No wonder — I read the whole thing, and I have major objections.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "有什么想法你说出来吧，在我们星天一向欢迎争论的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Speak your mind freely; here at Xingtian we have always welcomed debate.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "这点我深有体会。我在这个圈子混了二十年了，这样的改版方案我前所未见。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I know that firsthand. In twenty years in this industry, I have never seen a revamp proposal like this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "对于一个引进节目做这种高度的本土化创新，这在中国的电视界从来没有过。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Taking an imported format and giving it such deep homegrown innovation has never been done in Chinese television.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "如果我们台能够率先垂范接受这个方案，不仅会提高我们的品牌价值。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If our network sets the example by adopting this plan, it will elevate our entire brand value.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "这个改版方案最大的问题在于，这么好玩的事怎么不带我一块儿玩呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So the single biggest flaw in this revamp plan is: why didn't you invite me along for something this fun?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "闻老师，你不愧是独步江湖的段子手，我们开个讨论会你还卖关子呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Wen, you truly live up to your reputation as a master storyteller — keeping us in suspense during a review meeting!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你们星天要是不嫌弃的话，我个人愿意出任新一季十二歌王的主持人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If Xingtian doesn't mind, I would personally love to serve as host for the new season of Twelve Singers.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你要重回综艺舞台？闻老师，一言为定！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You're returning to the variety stage? Mr Wen, it's a deal!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在广告商那边已经同意改版了，邓主任是不是可以推动台里通过改版呢？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "邓主任有什么建议？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "我想知道，你们这个改版方案是谁搞的？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "怪不得呢，我都看了，我很有意见。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "有什么想法你说出来吧，在我们星天一向欢迎争论的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "这点我深有体会。我在这个圈子混了二十年了，这样的改版方案我前所未见。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "对于一个引进节目做这种高度的本土化创新，这在中国的电视界从来没有过。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "如果我们台能够率先垂范接受这个方案，不仅会提高我们的品牌价值。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "这个改版方案最大的问题在于，这么好玩的事怎么不带我一块儿玩呢？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "闻老师，你不愧是独步江湖的段子手，我们开个讨论会你还卖关子呢。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你们星天要是不嫌弃的话，我个人愿意出任新一季十二歌王的主持人。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你要重回综艺舞台？闻老师，一言为定！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Revealing with a grin that his only complaint was being left out of the fun, Wen Simo volunteers to return to variety television as host of Twelve Singers Season Three. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
